  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n5 (1 - x/5) - (5 - x) - 1/200 of (20 - x) = 0.08\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n5 (1 - x/5) - (5 - x) - 1/200 of (20 - x) = 0.08\n\n⇒ 5 (1 - x/5) - (5 - x) - 1/10 + x/200 = 8/100\n\n⇒ 5 - x - 5 + x - 1/10 + x/200 = 8/100\n\n⇒ x/200 - 1/10 = 8/100\n\n⇒ x/200 = 8/100 + 1/10\n\n⇒ x/200 = 18/100\n\n⇒ x/2 = 18\n\n⇒ x = 2 × 18\n\n⇒ x = 36\n\n**∴ The value of x is 36**",
